                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If Chuck Schumer and Hakeem Jeffries are so confident they\u2019re not trying to give illegal immigrants healthcare benefits, they should join me in calling on Kathy Hochul and New York Democrats to reverse this outrageous policy.",
