                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If the goal is to prevent Americans from facing a spike in healthcare premiums and to keep the government open, there\u2019s a straightforward way to do it:\n\nPass the clean CR in the Senate, extend the ACA subsidies, and stop holding the American people hostage. https://t.co/GQhZrvM0MT",
