                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Here are the facts: I\u2019ve said from Day 1 that nobody wins in a government shutdown \u2014 least of all the families in New York\u2019s 17th District who rely on veterans\u2019 care, Social Security, Medicare, and other essential services.\n\nI meant it when I fought to avert shutdowns in the past, and I mean it now.",
