                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Proud to join my colleagues in fighting to address health care costs once Senate Democrats reopen the federal government.\n\nRepublicans can and must lead with solutions that make healthcare more affordable without taking coverage away from those who depend on it. That\u2019s how we govern responsibly.",
