                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Obamacare hasn\u2019t delivered on its promise to lower healthcare costs for Americans.\n\nAddressing this long-term will take bipartisan cooperation and a careful look at every part of the system, from insurance and prescription drugs to the healthcare workforce. But it can\u2019t be fixed all at once during a month-long government shutdown.",
