                "text": "Healthcare premiums have risen by over 114% on the open market under Obamacare, even with the subsidies. \n\nWe have to address the fundamental failure of Obamacare, which is that it actually hasn\u2019t made healthcare insurance premiums in America more affordable. https://t.co/wRUAIElmUH",
