                "text": "While I support an extension to the ACA tax credits, we need serious bipartisan reform. Income thresholds need to be lowered. Someone making $600k should not be subsidized by the taxpayer. The focus of the subsidy should be on those who really cannot afford a healthcare plan. https://t.co/pITwgjheKu",
